msgid ""
"Activate this option if you want the selected email client to be executed in "
"a terminal (e.g. <em>Konsole</em>)."
msgstr ""
"Aktifkan pilihan ini jika anda mahu klien emel dipilih untuk dilaksanakan di terminal "
"(spt. <em> Konsole</em> )."

